{"id":1317,"title":"python 操作入门","summary":"python 操作入门","tags":"","components":[{"type":"QuizRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d8aae7cb-475d-3b94-8962-92b48c4c2ec0","title":"python 基础","question_id":2913,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"question_id":2913,"title":"python 基础","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1a1d18f9-5c2a-3cc6-b499-9d46b21ec5cb","title":"","title_html":"","text":"接下来的几个小节中，我们主要介绍Python基础的知识，保证大家能使用Python编写爬虫，但课程主要是爬虫相关的，所以不会深入学习Python语言自身知识<br>\n\n但如果你想深入了解Python 细节并写出更加炫酷的程序，可以配合我们出的[Python 入门课程](#/course/015/catalog)一起食用，学习效果更加。\n\n### 1. Python注释\n\n**注释** 的目的是让阅读者能够轻松读懂每一行代码的意义，同时也为后期代码维护提供便利。在 Python 中，单行注释以`#`号开头，如下所示。","text_html":"<p>接下来的几个小节中，我们主要介绍Python基础的知识，保证大家能使用Python编写爬虫，但课程主要是爬虫相关的，所以不会深入学习Python语言自身知识<br></p>\n<p>但如果你想深入了解Python 细节并写出更加炫酷的程序，可以配合我们出的<a href=\"#/course/015/catalog\">Python 入门课程</a>一起食用，学习效果更加。</p>\n<h3>1. Python注释</h3>\n<p><strong>注释</strong> 的目的是让阅读者能够轻松读懂每一行代码的意义，同时也为后期代码维护提供便利。在 Python 中，单行注释以<code>#</code>号开头，如下所示。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"75822772-16da-3d3e-801a-2fec57b1381e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 第一个注释\nprint('hello world')\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f4c61dfc-f0c2-353d-b09d-cdd8169f6c33","title":"","title_html":"","text":"Python 的多行注释用两个三引号`\"\"\"` 或 `'''`包含起来，如下所示。","text_html":"<p>Python 的多行注释用两个三引号<code>&quot;&quot;&quot;</code> 或 <code>&#x27;&#x27;&#x27;</code>包含起来，如下所示。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cac587b3-bfc9-3473-ab62-90eaf4b99a6f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 多行注释\n\"\"\"\n第一行注释\n第二行注释\n\"\"\"\n\n'''\n第一行注释\n第二行注释\n'''\n\nprint('hello world')\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"67a6fbf4-a06b-356a-b678-5890f8e1cf88","title":"","title_html":"","text":"### 2. python代码缩进\n\nPython 最具特色的就是**使用缩进来表示代码块**，不需要使用大括号`{}`。缩进的**空格数是可变的**，但是同一个代码块的语句必须包含**相同的缩进空格数**，缩进不一致会导致代码运行错误。\n\n正确缩进的示例如下:","text_html":"<h3>2. python代码缩进</h3>\n<p>Python 最具特色的就是<strong>使用缩进来表示代码块</strong>，不需要使用大括号<code>{}</code>。缩进的<strong>空格数是可变的</strong>，但是同一个代码块的语句必须包含<strong>相同的缩进空格数</strong>，缩进不一致会导致代码运行错误。</p>\n<p>正确缩进的示例如下:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0ae7861b-3b4d-3fca-8384-e31dbd6b135d","title":"","caption":"","language":"python","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"if True:\n    print(\"true\")\nelse:\n    print(\"false\")\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"versi